<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal fund assets up in May vs Dec '96.</title>
<headline>Portugal fund assets up in May vs Dec '96.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Assets of Portuguese fund investments rose 15 percent to 3,570 billion escudos by end-May 1997 from end-December 1996, said Jose Carlos Maia, president of the Portuguese Association of Fund Managers (APFIN).</p>
<p>(IN BILLION ESCUDOS)</p>
<p>				  MAY 1997  APRIL 1997 DECEMBER 1996</p>
<p>INVESTMENT FUNDS (EXCLUDING</p>
<p> PROPERTY)			3,098.5  3,047.2	2,647.9</p>
<p> PROPERTY FUNDS		   471.4*   471.4	 464.5</p>
<p> TOTAL			    3,569.9  3,518.6	3,112.4</p>
<p>(NOTE: * value not updated as property fund values are reassessed quarterly.)</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
